      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Fractional output\n\nModels: `kandinsky_imagesr_2.0.safetensors` (huggingface.co/hmdlsk/Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0-ComfyUI) in `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/` and the FLUX.1 VAE `ae.safetensors` in `ComfyUI/models/vae/`.\n\n**native restoration scale** (`upscale_factor`, 2x or 4x) is the scale the model actually restores at: it sets the tile geometry, the cost and the meaning of creativity. **output_scale** only sets the final size: the finished restoration is resized with antialiased bicubic resampling to round(input size x output_scale). 0 keeps the native size; 1.0 restores without enlarging. Restoring at 2x and outputting 1.2x costs the same as a plain 2x restoration.\n\nThis workflow restores at 2x with creativity 1 and returns 1.2x the input size. Low creativity tends to keep photographic texture and identity closer to the input; the best setting depends on the image."
      ],
      "title": "Kandinsky ImageSR",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
